    "verse": 44,
    "sanskrit": "तस्मात्प्रणम्य प्रणिधाय कायं\nप्रसादये त्वामहमीशमीड्यम् ।\nपितेव पुत्रस्य सखेव सख्युः\nप्रियः प्रियायार्हसि देव सोढुम् ।।११-४४।।",
    "transliteration": "tasmātpraṇamya praṇidhāya kāyaṃ prasādaye tvāmahamīśamīḍyam ।\npiteva putrasya sakheva sakhyuḥ priyaḥ priyāyārhasi deva soḍhum",
    "englishMeaning": "Therefore, bowing down, prostrating my body, I crave Thy forgiveness, O adorable Lord. As a father forgives his son, a friend his (dear) friend, a lover his beloved, even so shouldst Thou \nforgive me, O God.",
